return {
    ["        我站在“黑王座号”的船头，张开双臂，对格林和爱德华兹他们说：“想要我的财宝吗？那就到迷雾海的尽头来寻找吧，我将所有的财宝都藏在了这里！”\n        但他们完全不懂我的幽默，竟然问我是不是真的有额外的财宝。真是无趣啊，你们这样是做不了我的天启四骑士的！但他们依旧愿意追随我在那片充满迷雾的海洋里冒险。\n        我一直在想，北大陆西边是迷雾海，东面是苏尼亚海，我怀疑这两大海洋的尽头还有别的大陆，就像狂暴海的尽头是南大陆一样，说不定我能发现一个全新的大陆，西大陆！"] = "I stood at the bow of the \"Black Throne,\" spread my arms, and said to Green, Edwards, and the others, \"Do you want my treasure? Then go find it at the end of the Fog Sea; I have hidden all my treasure there!\" \n But they completely failed to understand my humor and actually asked if I really had extra treasure. How boring; you guys can't be my Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse like this! But they are still willing to follow me on adventures in that ocean full of fog. \n I have been thinking, to the west of the Northern Continent is the Fog Sea, and to the east is the Sonia Sea. I suspect that there are other continents at the ends of these two great oceans, just like the end of the Berserk Sea is the Southern Continent. Maybe I can discover a brand new continent, the Western Continent!",
    ["%s后删除"] = "Delete after %s",
    ["%s，好久不见：\n      我听说了你最近与西尔维娅艰辛的交战。辛苦了，你一直都很努力。我和苏茜搜集了一些有关西尔维娅的情报，希望能有所帮助：<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302108\">西尔维娅的记载</>\n      你所承受的命运写满了未知与危险，连我们也无法勘破你身上的迷雾和谜团。未来或许还有更多的险境、更大的危机在等待着我们。我们都需要变得更强，才能保护好自己和珍视的事物。但当你疲惫的时候，欢迎随时来命运咖啡厅坐坐，我这里有不错的红茶和糕点，或许你会喜欢。闲暇的时候，可以来陪我和苏茜聊聊天，让心态平和下来，一切都会好起来的。\n      不用担心，我和其他人都会尽力帮助你，随信附上一些提升实力的建议。<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">点此查看</>"] = "%s, long time no see: \n      I heard about your recent arduous battle with Sylvia. You've worked hard; you have always been very diligent. Susie and I have gathered some intelligence regarding Sylvia, and I hope it proves helpful: <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302108\">Records of Sylvia</>\n      The fate you bear is filled with unknowns and dangers; even we cannot pierce through the mist and mysteries surrounding you. Perhaps more perilous situations and greater crises await us in the future. We all need to become stronger to protect ourselves and the things we cherish. But when you are exhausted, you are always welcome to come to the Fate Café for a seat. I have some excellent black tea and pastries here that you might enjoy. In your spare time, feel free to come chat with Susie and me to calm your mind; everything will be alright. \n      Do not worry; I and the others will do our best to help you. Attached to this letter are some suggestions for improving your strength. <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250207\">Click here to view</>",
