    ["<P_Yellow>“月亮仆从”的核心成员</>\n代号“教授”，真实身份不详，下落不明，疑似整个献祭计划的策划者。\n代号“夫人”，五月庄园主人，收尸人途径序列4，主持献祭与新生仪式。\n代号“管家”，窥秘人途径序列5，知识皇冠的直接持有者。\n代号“风信子”……\n代号“蒲公英”……"] = "<P_Yellow>Core members of the \"Moon Servants\"</>\nCodename \"Professor\", real identity unknown, whereabouts unknown, suspected to be the mastermind behind the entire sacrificial plan.\nCodename \"Viscountess\", owner of May Manor, Sequence 4 of the Corpse Collector pathway, presides over the sacrifice and rebirth rituals.\nCodename \"Butler\", Sequence 5 of the Mystery Pryer pathway, direct holder of the Knowledge Crown.\nCodename \"Hyacinth\"...\nCodename \"Dandelion\"...",
