    ["　　……\n　　第五纪1173年，罗塞尔以上校身份平复了叛乱，推翻了腐朽的索伦王室的统治。\n　　他担任执政官，将<InvHighlight>因蒂斯王国</>改为<InvHighlight>因蒂斯共和国</>，带领这个伟大的国度正式踏入最为辉煌的罗塞尔时代。\n　　……（大片被啃食的痕迹）\n　　由于执着于对船只的改良与世界的探索，罗塞尔大帝除了自身热衷于探险之外，还积极组建<Mark id=\"#159\">探索队</>，他于狂暴海的风暴与乱流中开辟了通向<InvHighlight>南大陆</>的航道，让这片尘封于历史隔绝于世的广阔土地沐浴了新时代的阳光。\n　　……（大片被啃食的痕迹）"] = "... \n In 1173 of the Fifth Epoch, Roselle quelled the rebellion as a colonel and overthrew the rule of the corrupt Solon royal family. \n He served as Consul and changed the <InvHighlight> Kingdom of Intis </> to the <InvHighlight> Intis Republic </>, leading this great nation to officially step into the most glorious Roselle era. \n ... (Large areas of gnawed marks) \n Because of his obsession with the improvement of ships and the exploration of the world, in addition to his own enthusiasm for adventure, Emperor Roselle also actively organized <Mark id=\"#159\"> exploration teams </>. He opened up the shipping route to the <InvHighlight> Southern Continent </> amidst the storms and turbulence of the Berserk Sea, allowing this vast land, which had been sealed off from history and isolated from the world, to bathe in the sunshine of the new era. \n ... (Large areas of gnawed marks)",
